## Demo pre-build output
SchemaQuench/publish/

## Chocolatey package staging — binaries land here in CI at pack time.
## The leading negation re-includes the package directory (the global `tools/`
## rule above otherwise excludes it); the scoped ignores keep CI-staged
## binaries out of commits.
!packaging/chocolatey/schemasmith/tools/
packaging/chocolatey/schemasmith/tools/*.exe
packaging/chocolatey/schemasmith/tools/*.dll
packaging/chocolatey/schemasmith/tools/*.json
packaging/chocolatey/schemasmith/tools/*.nupkg

# Python (coverage gate check script)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# SchemaQuench run output — generated DDL scripts written to the invocation cwd
# during quench runs (e.g. "SchemaQuench - Quench Indexes localhost.db.sql").
# Run artifacts, regenerated on demand; never tracked.
SchemaQuench - *.sql

## Node (the schema-validation script installs ajv locally; CI installs it fresh)
node_modules/
package-lock.json
